ion Display: Enjoy clear, vibrant visuals with a 2.4-inch color TFT screen (240x320), ideal for efficient call management and real-time updates.</li><li>Advanced Call Management: Supports up to 6 SIP accounts, ensuring smooth communication and easy call switching. Enjoy features such as call hold, call transfer, and 5-way audio conferencing for seamless business operations.</li><li>HD Voice Quality: Equipped with wideband codecs including G.722 and OPUS-WB, the Dinstar C62UP delivers crystal-clear audio for superior voice quality during every call.</li><li>Programmable Keys: Customize your experience with multicolor, programmable keys that enable quick access to frequently used functions like speed dial and call forwarding.</li><li>Dual Ethernet Ports &amp; PoE Support: Dual 10/1000M Ethernet ports ensure reliable connectivity, while Power over Ethernet (PoE) minimizes cable clutter by providing both power and data through a single cable.</li><li>Easy Installation &amp; Configuration: With Plug and Play (PnP) functionality and remote provisioning support, setting up the Dinstar C62UP is fast and hassle-free. Additionally, you can remotely manage and troubleshoot the device for efficient maintenance.</li></ul><p>Secure Communication: The Dinstar C62UP supports multiple encryption methods, including TLS and SRTP, ensuring secure communications for your business.</p><h3>Why Choose the Dinstar C62UP?</h3><p>The Dinstar C62UP offers a cost-effective VoIP solution without compromising on performance or features. It's perfect for small to medium businesses, call centers, or remote offices looking to improve their communication infrastructure. With its affordable pricing, easy setup, and reliable performance, the Dinstar C62UP ensures that your team stays connected and productive, whether in the office or on the go.</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-